Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.78,0:00:51.88,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Let's travel all through the worldwide seas,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.98,0:00:54.22,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,raising our battle cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.01,0:00:56.85,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(518,498)}Raw provider\N{\fs40}SOFCJ-Raws
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.35,0:00:58.55,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,If you've made up your mind, let the signal for departure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.72,0:01:00.99,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,ring out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.36,0:01:11.57,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,That feeling we had when we set sail
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.65,0:01:15.07,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,is something I'll never forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.22,0:01:16.84,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Because of that
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.01,0:01:20.51,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,nothing will be able to scare me...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.79,0:01:26.78,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now, as the trip approaches, our racing heartbeats
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.97,0:01:33.72,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,engrave a rhythm of adventure in our shy hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.92,0:01:38.09,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Get all the treasures
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.19,0:01:40.40,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,while laughing out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.50,0:01:44.80,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Give them all out at a big party
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.90,0:01:47.44,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,making a splash...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.57,0:02:04.65,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Fill your empty heart with dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.79,0:02:06.99,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Spread your wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.21,0:02:11.33,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,If you color your heart with the blowing wind
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.43,0:02:13.66,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,you will move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.70,0:02:17.83,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Get all the treasures
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.00,0:02:20.17,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,while laughing out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.30,0:02:24.52,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Give them all out at a big party
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.71,0:02:27.31,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,making a splash...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.90,0:02:33.83,Title,,0,0,200,,{\an8\fad(2000,0)}智力與蠻力的結合！\N奧茲與乂利亞 VS 草帽海賊團！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.83,0:02:36.20,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,布魯克...你又能動了？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.20,0:02:38.74,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你救了我。非常感謝。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.74,0:02:41.63,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,當然，我受了重傷。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.63,0:02:45.57,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,然後我拖著傷痕累累的身體去廚房找鹽...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.57,0:02:51.28,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,我發現了一瓶美味的牛奶並喝了下去，結果就變成這樣！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.28,0:02:53.84,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,鈣質不可能那麼有效吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.80,0:02:58.27,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,牛奶可以修復骨頭！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.27,0:02:59.26,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,騙人！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.95,0:03:06.00,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,不管怎樣...我們在最後關頭取得了大量的鹽。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.50,0:03:09.08,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,通往廚房的路現在被堵住了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.08,0:03:11.96,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,布魯克帶來的鹽是我們最後的希望。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.96,0:03:13.21,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,時間不多了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.21,0:03:14.07,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,我們必須戰鬥！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.98,0:03:18.91,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,如果讓那怪物吞下鹽，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.91,0:03:21.95,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,然後緊接著打倒乂利亞，我們就能贏。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.00,0:03:36.04,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,你該慶幸我出來戰鬥了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.04,0:03:38.88,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,而且，如果我是你們的話，我會格外小心。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.34,0:03:42.33,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,我可不是無緣無故出來的！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.33,0:03:46.00,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,讓你們經歷最可怕的噩夢吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.00,0:03:51.04,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,請允許我加入戰鬥，我發誓會全力以赴！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.50,0:03:56.68,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,我想不出其他方式來報答你們奪回我影子的大恩！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.68,0:03:58.12,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,我要...！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.20,0:04:01.05,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,嘎吱...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.05,0:04:02.56,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,不要勉強自己。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.56,0:04:04.89,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,你就負責拿好那些鹽。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.49,0:04:08.51,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,讓我給你們看點特別的東西。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.51,0:04:11.02,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,我的反怪物彈藥。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.44,0:04:14.28,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,要搶得先機。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.28,0:04:16.55,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,上一發對你來說太小了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.55,0:04:17.91,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,佛朗基，拜託你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.91,0:04:20.56,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}必殺特製油星！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.14,0:04:23.90,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,當然！收到！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.41,0:04:29.36,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,變形！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.87,0:04:33.30,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}超級大號...火鳥星！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.69,0:04:37.59,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,好燙！好燙！好燙！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.59,0:04:39.07,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,真丟臉。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.07,0:04:40.99,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,別慌張，奧茲。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.99,0:04:45.81,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,熱度和疼痛是你還是人類時的阻礙。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.60,0:04:49.73,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,那種東西對殭屍沒有效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.73,0:04:51.70,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,冷靜下來把火焰弄掉。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.84,0:04:54.99,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,這是我們的機會，索隆！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.99,0:04:55.97,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.29,0:05:07.75,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}三刀流...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.09,0:05:11.00,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}大佛斬！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.38,0:05:16.56,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,吃這招！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.42,0:05:19.25,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}積木大砲！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.61,0:05:34.48,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.95,0:05:39.76,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,朝這邊來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.54,0:05:42.84,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}二十輪花！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.54,0:05:42.84,Note,,0,0,100,,{\fad(150,150)}二十朵花
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.97,0:05:48.71,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,住手，你這白痴！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.84,0:05:57.76,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.76,0:05:58.96,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,他用那招對付我們了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.96,0:06:00.87,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,喂，你沒事吧？！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.01,0:06:05.04,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}新武器...鍬形蟲！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.01,0:06:05.04,Note,Note,0,0,100,,{\fad(150,150)}鍬形蟲：鹿角甲蟲
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.16,0:06:09.75,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,準備好了嗎，騙人布？！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.75,0:06:13.66,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,是⋯是的，但這東西做得太荒唐了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.66,0:06:15.72,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我都不知道會發生什麼。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.72,0:06:17.79,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,不用擔心，笨蛋。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.79,0:06:21.29,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,這禮拜我可是感覺特別SUPER！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.29,0:06:22.72,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,那就上去吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.72,0:06:23.57,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,好的！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.57,0:06:26.16,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,用盡全力！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.37,0:06:29.24,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.24,0:06:32.06,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}必殺鐵人流星！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.44,0:06:37.32,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,這才叫SUPER！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.32,0:06:39.37,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,受死吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.37,0:06:43.34,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,這是專門用來打倒海王類的特殊臼砲！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.34,0:06:45.75,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,我要在你的臉上開個洞！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.75,0:06:47.45,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,接招吧，乂利亞！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.79,0:06:53.57,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,好驚人的敏捷度！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.57,0:06:56.53,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,我差點忘了我們其實是在跟魯夫打！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.50,0:07:07.34,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,佛朗基！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.24,0:07:14.65,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,佛朗基！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.12,0:07:20.02,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,還沒結束呢，奧茲。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.02,0:07:22.80,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,他還在呼吸。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.80,0:07:24.22,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,給他最後一擊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.69,0:07:25.88,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,是。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.92,0:07:42.51,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,喂，他又要做那招了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.51,0:07:44.29,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,住手，他根本動不了了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.95,0:07:46.18,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}雷電...！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.16,0:07:48.93,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,嗯？那片雲！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.93,0:07:49.99,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}節拍！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.85,0:07:51.90,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,閃電！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.90,0:07:53.32,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,這招是...！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.90,0:07:57.80,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,有效了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.80,0:07:59.09,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,他倒下了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.09,0:08:00.83,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,是天候棒！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.83,0:08:02.76,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,娜美小姐沒事吧？！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.76,0:08:04.32,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,剛才那道閃光是什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.32,0:08:05.39,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,閃電？！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.39,0:08:06.63,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,這麼突然？！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.63,0:08:09.09,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,奧茲被一道閃電擊中了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.09,0:08:10.24,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,很有可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.24,0:08:12.70,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,在那裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.14,0:08:14.55,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,是娜美小姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.63,0:08:18.32,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,娜美小姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.32,0:08:21.16,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,喂，別叫我的名字！他會注意到我的！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.16,0:08:24.70,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,太好了！太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.70,0:08:27.68,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,太好了，娜美小姐沒事！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.68,0:08:29.39,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.39,0:08:31.98,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,請原諒我的無能！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.98,0:08:33.93,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,娜美小姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.73,0:08:33.93,Secondary,Zoro,0,0,0,,他能不能閉嘴啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.38,0:08:37.91,Main,Oars,0,0,0,,女人...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.91,0:08:39.80,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,我說了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.86,0:08:42.97,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}橡膠...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.13,0:08:44.90,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,什⋯什麼？！什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.90,0:08:46.61,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,難道會伸長嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.61,0:08:48.47,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,不會到她那裡的。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.85,0:08:49.73,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,這是我們的機會！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.73,0:08:51.21,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,去幫助佛朗基！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.54,0:08:55.63,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}手槍！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.35,0:09:03.16,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,伸⋯伸長了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.16,0:09:04.34,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,為什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.98,0:09:11.70,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,伸長了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.70,0:09:14.30,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,難怪我一直有那種感覺。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.30,0:09:15.73,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,不可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.73,0:09:17.25,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,娜美！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.21,0:09:17.25,Secondary,Sanji,0,0,0,,娜美小姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.52,0:09:22.24,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,我看到她了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.24,0:09:23.48,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,娜美平安無事！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.78,0:09:26.77,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,太好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.77,0:09:28.50,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,羅賓救了她！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.86,0:09:35.61,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,這也太突然了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.61,0:09:37.08,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,你沒事吧，娜美？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.59,0:09:40.19,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,非常感謝...你們救了我。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.34,0:09:44.54,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,這絕對不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.54,0:09:46.96,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,他的手臂為什麼會伸長？！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.96,0:09:48.97,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,世界上只有一個橡膠人！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.51,0:10:00.71,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,乂利亞...都是他搞的鬼。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.89,0:10:02.84,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}橡膠...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.42,0:10:05.80,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}鞭腿！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.42,0:10:09.65,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,現在他完全變成了怪物版的魯夫！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.98,0:10:16.41,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,你們到底是誰？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.41,0:10:18.40,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我現在很忙！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.40,0:10:19.56,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,你們想幹什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.56,0:10:21.56,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,是的，我們知道你很忙。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.56,0:10:23.69,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,我們也知道你沒有時間可以浪費。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.69,0:10:25.33,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,只要給我們一分鐘！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.33,0:10:27.11,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,你是我們唯一的希望。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.11,0:10:28.44,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,我們一直在找你！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.14,0:10:34.90,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,我們是冒險兄弟，求婚蘿拉船長率領的滾動海賊團的手下。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.90,0:10:38.41,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,你想打倒乂科·乂利亞吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.41,0:10:39.30,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,想吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.57,0:10:43.34,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,我們知道乂利亞能力的秘密。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.34,0:10:45.57,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,它能賦予你無可匹敵的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.57,0:10:48.26,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,所以拜託你幫我們打倒他。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.26,0:10:50.92,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,秘密？力量？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.92,0:10:51.95,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,你覺得怎樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.58,0:10:55.17,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,所以我在問你：你到底在想什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.08,0:10:57.65,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,讓我介紹她。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.65,0:11:00.96,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,滾動海賊團的船長，求婚蘿拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.96,0:11:04.64,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,她目前為止的求婚次數是4443次。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.23,0:11:06.94,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,哎呀！我喜歡你。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.94,0:11:08.11,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,跟我結婚吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.11,0:11:09.26,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,不要。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.26,0:11:10.64,Main,Both,0,0,0,,他拒絕了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.64,0:11:13.85,Main,Both,0,0,0,,這是第4444個拒絕她的人！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.78,0:11:19.28,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,總之，我們是被奪走影子的受害者團體的一部分...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.28,0:11:20.85,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,註定在森林中徘徊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.85,0:11:24.05,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我的影子也被偷了，所以我沒有時間可以浪費！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.05,0:11:26.83,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,你是草帽魯夫吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.83,0:11:32.04,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,不管怎樣，Thriller Bark從來沒有過這麼大的混亂！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.24,0:11:39.44,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,乂利亞的三個手下被消滅了，他的宅邸也幾乎全毀了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.44,0:11:43.51,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,是啊，自從你來了之後我們都很興奮。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.51,0:11:48.72,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,但是...聽說敵人的王牌，特殊殭屍，已經被喚醒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.72,0:11:51.96,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,我們通過受害者網絡接收情報。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.96,0:11:54.83,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,我們已經三年沒有影子了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.83,0:11:57.45,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,我們不想再這樣活下去了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.45,0:12:01.77,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,如果你能打倒乂利亞，我們就都能拿回影子了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.77,0:12:04.15,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,話雖如此，我們有麻煩了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.15,0:12:06.42,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,你知道乂利亞現在在哪裡嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.42,0:12:07.92,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,在他的肚子裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.92,0:12:09.91,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,他在那怪物的肚子裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.91,0:12:12.44,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,什麼？！他被吃掉了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.93,0:12:14.12,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,不是那樣。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.12,0:12:16.12,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,他是坐在肚子裡面。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.12,0:12:22.15,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,基本上，除非你先打倒擁有你影子的特殊殭屍，否則就無法靠近乂利亞。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.15,0:12:26.67,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,他正在宅邸的庭院和你的夥伴們戰鬥。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.67,0:12:28.08,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.08,0:12:29.34,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.34,0:12:30.54,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,那我沒時間可以浪費了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.54,0:12:32.06,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,我叫你等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.30,0:12:36.25,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,把冗長的解釋留到後面！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.25,0:12:37.80,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,直接給他看例子比較快！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.80,0:12:40.70,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,影子秘密的例子！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.70,0:12:41.44,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.44,0:12:43.13,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,讓開！讓開！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.13,0:12:44.14,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.46,0:12:46.31,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,影子？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.31,0:12:48.33,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,沒錯，影子！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.33,0:12:53.62,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,讓殭屍吃了鹽後釋放出來的影子可以用手直接抓住！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.56,0:12:55.50,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.03,0:12:58.18,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,這⋯這是什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.18,0:12:59.81,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,你在用影子刺我！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.87,0:12:59.81,Secondary,Pirate,0,0,0,,撐住。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.93,0:13:04.05,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.05,0:13:05.73,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我要失去意識了...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.57,0:13:08.19,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.19,0:13:09.00,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,進去了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.18,0:13:10.97,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,怎麼樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.80,0:13:13.70,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,你恢復意識了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.12,0:13:14.78,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.97,0:13:18.50,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,你會用劍嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.43,0:13:21.51,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,完全...不會。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.22,0:13:33.42,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,發⋯發生了什麼事？！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.12,0:13:40.13,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,剛才進入你體內的影子...是一個劍術精湛的海軍軍人的。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.13,0:13:44.29,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,影子擁有的所有力量都會加到你自身的力量上！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.29,0:13:47.91,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,而且，只要你保持意識清醒，就可以繼續添加影子！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.29,0:13:49.92,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,很厲害吧？！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.92,0:13:55.17,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,我們可以利用乂利亞的能力來大幅提升你的實力！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.36,0:13:58.65,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,我們捕獲了大量的影子。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.65,0:14:03.96,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,但是，如果你意志不堅定容易失去意識的話，所有力量就白費了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.59,0:14:07.92,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,你們怎麼有那麼多影子？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.92,0:14:12.28,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,為了找到我們的影子，我們拼命地淨化了一個又一個殭屍。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.28,0:14:16.88,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,但我們只找到了不認識的人的影子。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.88,0:14:20.34,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,所以我們開始把它們捕獲起來。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.34,0:14:23.69,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,聽好了，一定要記住這件事。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.69,0:14:26.46,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,當影子放入屍體時，屍體就會變成殭屍，但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.46,0:14:29.15,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,當影子放入一個有靈魂和自我意識的活人體內時，它無法安定下來。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.77,0:14:32.30,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,你的強化最多只能持續10分鐘。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.30,0:14:36.14,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,之後，影子就會回到原來的主人那裡。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.14,0:14:37.58,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,你明白了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.58,0:14:38.92,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,是10分鐘的決勝負。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.92,0:14:43.47,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,我們拚了命捕獲的所有影子，全部給你！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.47,0:14:44.56,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,那麼多？！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.32,0:14:51.18,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,霧已經散了。也就是說，我們只剩下不到20分鐘的夜晚可以行動。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.18,0:14:52.87,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,不管怎樣，我們得快點。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.87,0:14:54.78,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,保持意識清醒！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.78,0:14:58.28,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,你應該能承受20或30個影子！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.28,0:15:01.45,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,我們的極限是2到3個。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.36,0:15:04.35,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,來吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.44,0:15:07.52,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,等⋯等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.52,0:15:09.27,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,會不會太快了{\fscx250}-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.81,0:15:18.62,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,這⋯這個男人...！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.62,0:15:21.45,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,他到底擁有怎樣的意志？！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.45,0:15:24.65,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,我不敢相信我的眼睛...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.04,0:15:28.94,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,他一口氣吸收了100個影子！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.94,0:15:30.45,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,難以置信！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.45,0:15:32.44,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,不愧是我們的希望之光！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.78,0:15:35.21,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,喂⋯喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.21,0:15:37.12,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,你感覺如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.12,0:15:38.70,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,你還是你嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.70,0:15:40.80,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,草帽魯夫！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.80,0:15:42.40,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.40,0:15:44.12,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,是我。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.18,0:15:50.86,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,力量不斷地...湧出來！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.68,0:15:53.76,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,怎麼說呢...你...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.76,0:15:56.48,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,你變了...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.48,0:15:58.99,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,你之前小一點。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.99,0:16:02.67,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,我從沒想過這小子會這麼強。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.67,0:16:04.83,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,對戰鬥的渴望...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.83,0:16:07.39,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,在體內燃燒著！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.39,0:16:09.40,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,你準備好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.40,0:16:11.13,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,現在，沒有時間了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.13,0:16:13.90,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,讓那該死的乂利亞見識什麼才是真正的噩夢！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.90,0:16:15.64,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,你是我們最後的希望之光！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.64,0:16:17.07,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,噩夢魯夫！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.15,0:16:23.81,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,你給我等著！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.81,0:16:26.92,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,乂利亞！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.92,0:16:28.61,Main,Pirates,0,0,0,,等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.61,0:16:31.62,Main,Pirates,0,0,0,,你走錯方向了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.62,0:16:34.07,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)}橡膠...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.07,0:16:34.82,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,他來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.16,0:16:37.14,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}鐘擺！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.91,0:16:45.18,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,能伸長的感覺真好。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.42,0:16:47.02,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}長矛！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.80,0:16:58.78,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,可惡，怎麼回事？！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.78,0:17:01.07,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,他的攻擊力大幅提升了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.07,0:17:04.59,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,奧茲的身體為什麼能伸長？他又沒有惡魔果實的能力？！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.59,0:17:06.67,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,你做了什麼，乂利亞？！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.92,0:17:12.99,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,沒錯！真正的噩夢現在才開始！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.99,0:17:15.31,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,見識影子的力量吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.41,0:17:17.02,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}影之革命！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.27,0:17:23.69,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,革⋯革命？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.97,0:17:27.21,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,影子必須服從身體的命令。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.21,0:17:28.89,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,這是常識。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.37,0:17:33.40,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,身體和影子永遠保持相同的形態。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.40,0:17:35.29,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,這是不可侵犯的規則。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.29,0:17:36.44,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,然而，現在...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.44,0:17:42.53,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,本應服從奧茲身體的影子，正被我的影子所操控。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.53,0:17:45.78,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,你們能看出發生了什麼嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.78,0:17:50.30,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,我可以隨意改變奧茲影子的形狀。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.30,0:17:55.34,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,但是，身體和影子必須保持相同的形狀。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.34,0:18:03.04,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,為了讓身體和影子一致，身體被迫服從影子的變化而跟著改變。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.04,0:18:05.46,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,影之革命！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.76,0:18:08.26,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,換句話說，通過逆轉常識，
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.26,0:18:14.25,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,乂利亞強迫奧茲的影子伸長，所以身體也被迫跟著伸長了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.25,0:18:17.84,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,也就是說...奧茲並沒有變成橡膠人...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.84,0:18:20.18,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,他變成了可以變成任何形態的怪物！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.18,0:18:23.52,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,這麼大的怪物還這麼方便！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.52,0:18:26.35,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,是啊，現在想靠近他就沒那麼容易了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.60,0:18:31.36,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,你們很快就會發現它比橡膠更可怕！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.22,0:18:35.16,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,如果我把他的影子變圓，
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.51,0:18:39.20,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,奧茲也會跟著變圓！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.92,0:18:44.07,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}奧茲球！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.54,0:18:47.47,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,接招！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.61,0:18:54.12,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,快逃！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.97,0:19:01.47,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,喂喂！等一下，主人！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.47,0:19:04.30,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,別妨礙我的戰鬥！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.55,0:19:06.92,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,抱歉抱歉。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.92,0:19:08.59,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,我不是故意破壞你的樂趣。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.59,0:19:11.16,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,我只是來幫你一把而已。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.16,0:19:15.37,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,好了，奧茲，把他們一個一個碾碎吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.47,0:19:23.41,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,太靠近很危險，索隆！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.11,0:19:26.96,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,喂，魯夫到底去哪了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.96,0:19:29.48,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,乂利亞把他騙到別的地方去了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.48,0:19:31.12,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,他最好沒事！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.12,0:19:32.39,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,怎麼會？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.39,0:19:35.08,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,他真的是個大白痴。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.08,0:19:36.33,Thoughts,Nami,0,0,0,,怎麼辦？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.33,0:19:39.71,Thoughts,Nami,0,0,0,,在這種情況下，我是不是該告訴大家，
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.71,0:19:43.06,Thoughts,Nami,0,0,0,,還有另一個七武海在這個島上。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.71,0:19:51.89,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,所以現在的情況是：我們得先打倒魯夫的殭屍，再打倒乂利亞，否則就拿不回影子？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.89,0:19:53.65,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,是這樣的情況嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.65,0:19:55.39,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,是的，如你所說。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.39,0:19:56.15,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,不會吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.15,0:19:57.72,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,馬上就要天亮了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.72,0:19:59.49,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,那正是敵人想要的！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.49,0:20:00.95,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我們別無選擇！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.95,0:20:02.35,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,打擾一下。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.97,0:20:05.84,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,骷髏，你一直都在嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.84,0:20:07.32,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,我有個...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.32,0:20:09.47,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,我有個請求！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.47,0:20:10.80,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,請聽我說！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.20,0:20:16.46,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,各位，非常感謝你們！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.46,0:20:18.46,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,這是個簡單的請求。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.46,0:20:20.71,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你確定嗎，布魯克？！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.71,0:20:23.83,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你看到佛朗基的下場了吧？！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.83,0:20:26.72,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,發生什麼事我可不負責！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.72,0:20:29.20,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,做好準備，這東西威力很大！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.30,0:20:31.48,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}陰天節拍...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.82,0:20:38.18,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,請吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.18,0:20:41.65,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,居然又要用鍬形蟲！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.65,0:20:45.87,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,欠了人情債是最痛苦的！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.37,0:20:49.83,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,不要留手！用盡全力！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.83,0:20:52.31,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,好！出發！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.31,0:20:53.45,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,我上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.63,0:20:54.88,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}回轉藤蔓！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.52,0:21:05.52,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,衝擊大到骨頭都看得到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.52,0:21:08.30,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,話說回來，我本來就只有骨頭！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.30,0:21:09.90,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,我來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.90,0:21:11.43,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,像閃電之箭一樣！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.12,0:21:14.87,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)}雷骨劍...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.32,0:21:18.00,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}嘉禾舞·前方跳躍！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.32,0:21:18.00,Note,Brook,0,0,100,,{\fad(150,150)}前方跳躍：向前飛躍
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.19,0:21:20.17,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,太厲害了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.17,0:21:21.33,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,他直接穿過去了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.29,0:21:24.14,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,我的肩膀被刺穿了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.14,0:21:25.17,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,他露出破綻了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.17,0:21:26.21,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,再攻擊一次！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.00,0:21:30.15,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,任⋯任務...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.15,0:21:32.15,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,完成了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.15,0:21:33.50,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,好樣的，白骨！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.70,0:21:35.82,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}二刀流...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.82,0:21:36.37,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)}二段斬...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.29,0:21:38.27,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}登樓！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.99,0:21:45.49,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,你這傢伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.49,0:21:47.45,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,不，首先...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.45,0:21:50.39,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,我要先解決這個骷髏！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.63,0:21:52.32,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)}橡膠...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.32,0:21:54.06,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,他⋯他該不會要...？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.32,0:21:53.43,Secondary,Oz,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,150)}橡膠...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.34,0:21:56.18,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}戰斧！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.96,0:21:58.06,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,布魯克！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.61,0:22:07.17,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}必殺...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.17,0:22:09.81,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}巨人甲蟲彗星！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.10,0:22:19.41,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,沒用的！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.14,0:22:21.15,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,不妙。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.15,0:22:22.30,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,騙人布，快打！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.30,0:22:23.04,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,打啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.04,0:22:24.32,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,喂喂，等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.32,0:22:31.26,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,下一個就是你了，長鼻子混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.44,0:22:36.32,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}橡膠...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.70,0:22:39.15,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)}火箭炮！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.15,0:22:41.04,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我死定了！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.15,0:22:41.04,Secondary,Oz,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,150)}火箭炮！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.04,0:22:53.20,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,沒有伸長。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.20,0:22:54.39,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,為什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.58,0:22:57.07,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}八十輪花...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.58,0:22:57.07,Note,Note,0,0,100,,{\fad(150,150)}八十朵花
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.65,0:22:58.92,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}四手！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.65,0:22:58.92,Note,Note,0,0,100,,{\fad(150,150)}四隻手
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.03,0:23:07.31,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,這些手是怎麼回事？！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.31,0:23:08.50,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,我動不了了！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.88,0:23:14.17,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,是的，我想讓你停止操控影子。
Comment: 0,0:00:57.22,0:01:01.52,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(518,550)}Title card artist\N{\fs40}someone
